#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0013 expect=skipped domain=SE
#note "SE is out of CDISC-CG0013 scope since 2026-10-02 (Domains.Exclude): SE Assumptions 12/13 (SDTMIG 3.2; 10/11 in 3.3/3.4) permit adding Timing variables to SE, so SE is checked by the split sibling CDISC-CG0013-A. SESTDY here is not in the SE model list and would be reported if the SE exclusion were dropped."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library model-column-order SE STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID SESEQ ETCD ELEMENT SESTDTC SEENDTC TAETORD EPOCH SEUPDES
dataset SE
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SESEQ type=Num
col ETCD type=Char
col SESTDTC type=Char
col SEENDTC type=Char
col EPOCH type=Char
col SESTDY type=Num
---
S1 | SE | 001 | 1 | SCRN | 2012-07-06 | 2012-07-09 | SCREENING | -3
---
